# Wiki edits

- Keep pages short. One concern per file.
- `memory.md` is current truth. Do not duplicate long architecture here.
- Locked facts: strike-through the old line, write the new one, changelog the date.
- Changelog: keep the last ~5 dated lines. Older history is git.
- Do not move scoring rules out of `problem.md` or the allow-list out of `stack.md`.
